      "message": "We did `stgdiff -s -f short -o diff.txt -F fidelity.txt gki/aarch64/abi.stg microdroid/aarch64/abi.stg` and we have only those additions to ABI surface:\n```\n3 function symbol(s) added\n  \u0027void* mas_erase(struct ma_state*)\u0027\n  \u0027int mas_store_gfp(struct ma_state*, void*, gfp_t)\u0027\n  \u0027int mtree_store_range(struct maple_tree*, unsigned long, unsigned long, void*, gfp_t)\u0027\n  \n2 type(s) changed from ABSENT to FULLY_DEFINED:\n  struct mm_cid\n  struct rseq\n```\n\nThese types and symbols are very unlikely to break, so having microdroid ABI stabilized shouldn\u0027t block regular development and LTS merges.",
      "revId": "3b8c326d7c061e43cffe34b7c375b4bd33111249",
